# from brain
brain/# will have compiled files and executables
brain/debug/
brain/target/
brain/
brain/# Editor configuration
brain/.vscode/
brain/.zed/
brain/.helix/
brain/.nvim.lua
brain/
brain/# These are backup files generated by rustfmt
brain/**/*.rs.bk
brain/
brain/# MSVC Windows builds of rustc generate these, which store debugging information
brain/*.pdb
brain/
brain/# RustRover
brain/#  JetBrains specific template is maintained in a separate JetBrains.gitignore that can
brain/#  be found at https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/Global/JetBrains.gitignore
brain/#  and can be added to the global gitignore or merged into this file.  For a more nuclear
brain/#  option (not recommended) you can uncomment the following to ignore the entire idea folder.
brain/#.idea/
brain/
brain/
brain/# Ignore .DS_Store file in mac
brain/**/.DS_Store
brain/
brain/build/
